87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (Preparing a class timetable manually can be time-consuming because several conditions must be considered together. A teacher cannot be assigned to two classes at the same time, a room cannot host two classes in one slot, and each subject must receive its required number of periods. A timetable generator helps organize these requirements and reduces repeated manual work.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
