/T (The Time Table Generator demonstrates how Java collections and a greedy scheduling algorithm can be combined to create a class timetable while checking teacher and room conflicts. It also demonstrates basic integration between a frontend built with HTML, CSS and JavaScript and a Spring Boot backend through a REST API. The project is simple to understand and demonstrate, and it can be extended with databases, additional constraints and more advanced scheduling techniques.)
